    logic:candidateExtractionProvenance "doc-section/foundation harvest over the occurrent structure (design/LOGIC-FOUNDATION.md, the occurrent section), NOT a single annotation-field harvest — the Event/Situation contrast is spread across the occurrent design prose; anchored to logic:Event's skos:definition for drift detection"^^xsd:string ;
